        <mxCell id="note3" value="&lt;b&gt;Notes&lt;/b&gt;&#xa;• purchase.COMPANY_NAME is the ONLY real foreign key in the schema (constraint fkr3 → company.NAME, ON UPDATE/DELETE CASCADE).&#xa;• All statements are string-concatenated (injection).&#xa;• Company combo is populated by a full SELECT NAME FROM company." style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;align=left;fontSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="1">
